## 4. 📐 8 UML Diagrams ka Breakdown (`diagrams/` folder)

Hamare `diagrams/` folder mein saare 8 diagrams `.png` aur `.puml` dono formats mein maujood hain:

1. **Class Diagram (`1_class_diagram.png`)**: System ki **8 classes** dikhata hai (`User`, `Gamer`, `Admin`, `Game`, `Review`, `PerformanceLog`, `AnalyticsEngine`, `Report`) aur unke beech Inheritance, Association aur Composition relationships.
2. **Object Diagram (`2_object_diagram.png`)**: Ek specific moment ka snapshot dikhata hai jismein real objects aur values hain:
   - `admin1 : Admin` (`A-101`, `admin_usman`)
   - `gamer1 : Gamer` (`G-201`, `shadow_ninja`, `45.5 hrs`)
   - `cyberGame : Game` (`GM-501`, `Cyber Odyssey`, `Action`)
   - `perfLog1 : PerformanceLog` (`LOG-301`, `72.4 FPS`, `CPU 64%`, `GPU 91.5%`, `1440p`)
   - `review1 : Review` (`REV-901`, `rating = 4`, `"Great story and visuals"`)
   - `gameReport : Report` (`REP-001`, `overallScore = 82.5`)
   *(Note: Yehi exact values hamari Java app start hote hi Dashboard par dikhti hain!)*
3. **Use Case Diagram (`3_use_case_diagram.png`)**: Actors (`Admin`, `Gamer`, aur `Analytics Engine`) aur 7 use cases dikhata hai, jismein `<<include>>` relationship se `Calculate Ratings & System Stability` har action ke saath chalta hai.
4. **Sequence Diagram (`4_sequence_diagram.png`)**: Step 1 se Step 21 tak time-ordered messages dikhata hai (`login()` -> `logSession()` -> `submitReview()` -> `calculateAverageRating()` -> `calculateAverageFps()` -> `Display Updated Analytics`).
5. **Communication Diagram (`5_communication_diagram.png`)**: Sequence diagram ka hi object-link view hai (`1: Gamer`, `2: System Interface`, `3: Game`, `4: Analytics Engine`, `5: Database`).
6. **Activity Diagram (`6_activity_diagram.png`)**: 3 Swimlanes (`Gamer / User`, `System UI & Game`, `Analytics Engine & DB`) mein login check aur phir `Submit Review` ya `Log Performance` ka flowchart dikhata hai.
7. **Component Diagram (`7_component_diagram.png`)**: System ko 3 layers mein divide karta hai: **Presentation Layer** (`UI / GUI Component`), **Business Logic Layer** (`Authentication`, `Game Management`, `Review & Performance Logger`, `Analytics Engine`), aur **Data Access Layer** (`Database Handler Component`).
8. **Deployment Diagram (`8_deployment_diagram.png`)**: 3 nodes dikhata hai: `Client Device (Gamer/Admin PC)` -> `Application Server / Local Execution Environment` -> `Database Server / Storage Node`.

