## 5. 🖥️ Live Lab Demo Script (2 Minute Mein Miss ko Kaise Dikhana Hai)

1. **App Chalaana:** Project folder mein `.\run.bat` par double-click karo (ya terminal mein `javac -d out src\*.java` aur `java -cp out Main` chalao).
2. **Screen 1 — Analytics Dashboard:**
   - Miss ko dikhao ke Object Diagram wala exact data (`Cyber Odyssey GM-501`, `4.0 / 5.0` Rating, `72.4 FPS`, `82.5 / 100` Stability Score, `LOG-301` by `shadow_ninja`) saamne load hua hai.
   - Top-right par **"Export Report"** button dabao — popup mein `REP-001` report khul jayegi (`Report.exportReport()`).
3. **Screen 2 — Log FPS Session:**
   - Sidebar se **Log FPS Session** kholo, `Cyber Odyssey` select karo, Player name `usman`, Resolution `1440p`, FPS `95`, CPU `50`, GPU `80` daal kar **Log Session** dabao.
4. **Screen 3 — Submit Review:**
   - Sidebar se **Submit Review** kholo, 5th star par click karo (`5 / 5`), comment likho aur **Submit Review** dabao (batao ke abhi ye review `PENDING` hai).
5. **Screen 4 — Admin Moderation:**
   - Sidebar se **Admin Moderation** kholo — abhi wala review `PENDING` list mein dikhega. Usay select karke **Approve** dabao (aur kisi spam review ko **Delete** karke dikhao).
6. **Wapas Dashboard par Jao:**
   - Dikhao ke Average Rating, Average FPS, Stability Score aur FPS Line Chart sab live update ho gaye hain!
